{
  "source": "mailchimp",
  "target": "listmonk",
  "target_notes": "Listmonk stores subscribers with email, name, and a free-form JSONB attribs object (custom fields live at attribs.<key>). Segments are SQL queries over subscribers (e.g. subscribers.attribs->>'zip' LIKE '112%'); there is no engagement or rating signal to query. Subscriber status is enabled or blocklisted, plus a per-list subscription status of unconfirmed, confirmed, or unsubscribed. Templates use Go template syntax: {{ .Subscriber.Attribs.first_name }}, {{ .Subscriber.Email }}, {{ UnsubscribeURL }}, {{ MessageURL }} (hosted copy of the message).",
